
# Smart Property & Facility Management Platform

A backend application built with FastAPI for managing properties, buildings, units, tenants, leases, rent collection, payments, maintenance, utilities, visitors, parking, and facility bookings.

## Tech Stack

- Python 3.10+
- FastAPI
- Pydantic
- SQLAlchemy ORM
- PostgreSQL / SQLite
- JWT Authentication
- Alembic
- Uvicorn
- Pytest

## Features

### Authentication & User Management

- JWT authentication
- Access and refresh tokens
- Password hashing
- Role-based authorization
- Account activation/deactivation
- Password change

Supported roles:

- Super Admin
- Property Manager
- Facility Manager
- Maintenance Staff
- Security Staff
- Tenant

### Property Management

- Create properties
- Search and filter properties
- Update properties
- Soft delete properties
- Property status management

Supported property types:

- Apartment
- Villa
- Commercial
- Office
- Warehouse

### Building & Unit Management

- Building management
- Unit management
- Unit availability tracking
- Occupied/available/maintenance status
- Unit validation

### Tenant Management

- Tenant profiles
- Tenant search and filtering
- Tenant rental history

### Lease Management

- Create leases
- Active lease validation
- Overlapping lease prevention
- Lease termination
- Automatic unit occupancy updates

### Rent & Payment Management

- Rent invoice generation
- Automatic invoice total calculation
- Payment processing
- Duplicate transaction prevention
- Payment history
- Invoice balance validation

Invoice total:

`Total = Rent + Late Fee - Discount`

### Maintenance Management

- Maintenance requests
- Priority management
- Staff assignment
- Status tracking
- Work orders
- Maintenance audit history

Priorities:

- Low
- Medium
- High
- Emergency

### Utility Management

Supported utilities:

- Electricity
- Water
- Gas
- Internet

Automatic calculations:

`Units Consumed = Current Reading - Previous Reading`

`Amount = Units Consumed × Rate`

### Visitor Management

- Visitor registration
- Visitor status tracking
- Check-in
- Check-out
- Visitor history
- Visitor approval notifications

### Parking Management

- Parking slot creation
- Vehicle assignment
- Vehicle uniqueness validation
- Parking release
- Parking occupancy tracking

### Facility Booking

Supported facilities include:

- Gym
- Swimming Pool
- Conference Room
- Club House
- Sports Area

Includes:

- Booking management
- Time overlap prevention
- Capacity validation
- Booking confirmation notifications

### Notifications

Implemented using FastAPI BackgroundTasks for:

- Maintenance updates
- Visitor approval
- Facility booking confirmation

### Search, Filtering & Pagination

The APIs support filtering, pagination and sorting where implemented.

Common parameters include:

- `page`
- `limit`
- `sort_by`
- `sort_order`

### Dashboard & Analytics

Dashboard APIs provide management statistics including:

- Properties
- Buildings
- Units
- Occupancy
- Tenants
- Leases
- Rent collection
- Pending/overdue rent
- Maintenance expenses
- Utility revenue
- Parking occupancy

### Security & Data Integrity

- JWT authentication
- Role-based access control
- Password hashing
- Foreign key constraints
- Unique constraints
- Database transactions
- Soft delete
- Audit logging
- CORS
- Rate limiting
- Input validation

